item.description:
Joseph Topping reports an incident at the School District of Monroe in Wisconsin has resulted in the district pulling the plug on internet connections: Students powered down computers, school phone service failed and a scheduled ACT session was canceled after a possible network security issue disrupted the School District of Monroe in Wisconsin. Classes continued...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/09/14/possible-cyber-incident-disrupts-monroe-schools-in-wisconsin/">Source</a></p>

