DysruptionHub reports: Cedar County Memorial Hospital in El Dorado Springs, Missouri, shut down its IT networks Aug. 14 after a disruption left its electronic health record, patient portal and internet access unavailable. The outage also disrupted diagnostic imaging. Hospital systems could not transmit images to radiologists, so the emergency department partially diverted trauma and critical...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/09/15/ransomware-group-claims-attack-on-missouris-cedar-county-memorial-hospital-after-it-outage/">Source</a></p>

